# Generated evidence/runtime output under ph6/ (added 2026-11-21, PROPOSED, ratified_by=null).
# Only affects UNTRACKED files: evidence already committed under these paths stays tracked.
# Inspected 2026-11-21: 144,838 untracked files in validation_runs/ and 12,477 in runtime/
# (json/.blake2b/.bin/.yuv/.png/.wav run output, reports, 2 run-specific analysis scripts).
# Real untracked source in ph6/cram_pu (schemas/, tests/, tools/, measurement_writer.py) is NOT matched.
ph6/cram_pu/validation_runs/
ph6/cram_pu/runtime/
ph6/cram_pu/cram_pu/
ph6/validation_runs/

